      "value": "N_c(w) will remain ≤ 6 across w ∈ [5, 40], with out-of-sample error ≤ 1e-3 achieved at fixed width; training error will be near zero for all widths ≥ N_c(w). If N_c(w) exceeds 10 or grows with w, the hypothesis is rejected."
    },
